  "modelLimits": "This is bounded campus-core ground detail, not a survey or exhaustive campus surface inventory. Coordinates and retained source tags are unchanged. Widths with widthSource=class-estimate, crosswalk width, curb dimensions (0.10 m low-curb interpretation only along the four photographed Oval/Palm Drive segments), texture scale and joint patterns are estimates. Unknown source surfaces remain unknown except the documented Memorial Court and Lasuen photographic interpretations. The 2023 Lasuen image establishes asphalt in that corridor; extending that material across selected Lasuen segments is an inference, not per-segment photographic verification. Crossing positions are mapped; only explicit crossing:markings supplies a paint style. Missing/unmarked tags never imply zebra stripes. Recent construction may have changed some segments.",
